  broncos blitz was the fewest blitzes  that dak had seen all year you've been  one of the most blitz quarterbacks in  the nfl uh so get pressure with with  four  and disguise coverages play coverage  that and take away the big play that  seems to be what the chargers  who had success even though they lost  the game and what victangio did  yesterday great to talk to you as always  ed thank you  thanks for the invite dan clean the desk  will you no no never adding more  tchotchkes here not less  that's ed werder espn nfl reporter  covering the cowboys

